{"ErrorMessage":null,"FrienlyMessage":null,"Data":{"Metadata":{"component_title":"Nurses (Per 1,000 Population) - Annually","component_title_ar":"الممرضون (لكل 1,000 من السكان) - سنوي","component_subtitle":"This indicator measures the number of nurses per 1000 per population in the Emirate of Abu Dhabi. Nurse: A person who has completed a basic nursing education program and is legally licensed to practice nursing, providing care and support to individuals and communities. Population Size: It is defined as the sum of individuals within the boundaries of the State at a given date, whether they are citizens or permanent or temporary residents. The population size is usually estimated for a specific year in the middle of that year.","component_subtitle_ar":"يقيس هذا المؤشر عدد الممرضين لكل 1,000 السكان في إمارة أبوظبي. الممرض: هو الشخص الذي أكمل برنامج التعليم الأساسي في التمريض ومخوّل قانونيًا لممارسة مهنة التمريض، ويقدّم الرعاية والدعم للأفراد والمجتمعات حجم السكان: مجموع الأفراد القاطنين ضمن حدود الدولة في تاريخ معين سواء كانوا يتمتعون بصفة المواطنة للدولة أم كانوا مقيمين إقامة دائمة أو مؤقتة. ويقدر حجم السكان عادة لسنة معينة في منتصف هذه السنة.","data_source":"SCAD Official","updated":"2025-09-24T00:00:00"},"MetaDataAndMethodology":null,"Properties":"","Configuration":[{"id":"line-chart-a1794522728927939","type":"line-chart","indicatorId":"2705","seriesMeta":[{"type":"solid","xAccessor":{"type":"date","path":"OBS_DT","specifier":"%Y-%m-%d"},"yAccessor":{"type":"value","path":"VALUE"},"id":"a1794522728927939","dbIndicatorId":"2705","label":null,"color":"#000000"}],"tooltipTitleFormat":"date_MMM y","tooltipValueFormat":"number_1.1-2","xAxisFormat":"date_y","yAxisFormat":"number_1.1-2","xAxisLabel":"","yAxisLabel":"Nurse per 1,000 population","viewName":"VW_STATISTICAL_INDICATORS","markersMeta":[],"dbColumn":"INDICATOR_ID","relatedSV":[],"yAxisLabel_ar":"ممرض لكل 1,000 من السكان","dimension":false,"componentTitle":"Nurses (Per 1,000 Population) - Annually","componentTi